<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT TOSHIBA CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT TOSHIBA CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1996-08-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000 Toshiba Classic tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>1-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat 3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) 1-6, 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>4-Kimiko Date (Japan) beat 2-Conchita Martinez (Spain) 6-2 7-5.</p>
</text>
